<title>BELGIUM: EU cereals management committee has light agenda.</title>
<headline>EU cereals management committee has light agenda.</headline>
<dateline>BRUSSELS 1997-01-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>The European Union's rice and cereals management committee will hold a routine end of month meeting on Thursday, an EU official said on Tuesday.</p>
<p>&quot;The committee will discuss altering regulation (1947/96) to allow the sale of 49,000 tonnes of barley from Danish intervention but the rest of the agenda is just routine end of the month items,&quot; the official said. -- Brussels Newsroom 32 2 287 6800</p>
</text>
